    "Mientras tengas cuenta. Si borras un Kit, en el servidor queda marcado como borrado para que no reaparezca en tus otros dispositivos, y desaparece del todo al eliminar la cuenta. Si eliminas tu cuenta, borramos de inmediato todos tus datos del servidor y desvinculamos StepKit de tu Apple Account.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "As long as you have an account. If you delete a Kit, it stays marked as deleted on the server so it doesn't reappear on your other devices, and it disappears completely when you delete your account. If you delete your account, we immediately delete all your data from the server and unlink StepKit from your Apple Account."
          }
        }
      }
    },
