            "value": "Your StepKit account and everything saved in it will be deleted. This can't be undone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Se borrarán tu cuenta y todos tus Kits, avances y sesiones, y StepKit dejará de estar vinculado a tu Apple Account. Te pediremos que lo confirmes con Apple. Si tienes StepKit Pro, cancela la suscripción en Ajustes > Apple Account > Suscripciones: eliminar la cuenta no la cancela.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your account and all your Kits, progress and sessions will be deleted, and StepKit will be unlinked from your Apple Account. We'll ask you to confirm with Apple. If you have StepKit Pro, cancel the subscription in Settings > Apple Account > Subscriptions: deleting your account doesn't cancel it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
